## Role Matrix

| Activity | Cursor Submitter Mode | Reviewer | Adjudicator |
| -------- | --------------------- | -------- | ----------- |
| Review original task | Yes (read-only) | Independently repeat | As needed |
| Modify supplied task | **No** | No; normally requests revision | No normal authoring |
| Choose task assessment | Valid as-is, Fixable, Not Fixable | Verify submitter assessment | Resolve disagreement |
| Final Cursor workflow output | Paste-ready platform answers only | Accept, Needs Revision, Reject | Final decision |
| Create corrected ZIP | **No** | N/A | N/A |
| Run local oracle/NOP | Optional isolated disposable copy / supplied logs only | Optional | Optional |
| Check rebuttal/comments | Add useful comments | Required before final review | Review both sides |

Do **not** combine submitter and reviewer verdict systems.

Do **not** interpret “submitter” or “Fixable” as permission to edit the supplied task in this workspace.

