## Current vs Legacy Artifacts

**Current format is the default** unless the package or platform clearly uses legacy structure.

| Purpose | Current Sentinel Ultra | Legacy compatibility |
| ------- | ---------------------- | -------------------- |
| Oracle patch | `solution/golden.patch` | `init_state.patch` may appear |
| Problem statement | `environment/problem_statement.md` | May be absent in old packages |
| Test declaration | `tests/config.json` | Older tasks may rely on shell logic |
| Grading | `tests/grade.py` | May be absent in old packages |
| Added f2p tests | `tests/tests.patch` | `tests/files/` may also appear |
| Submitter verdict | Valid as-is, Fixable, Not Fixable | Valid or Invalid variants |
| Reviewer verdict | Accept, Needs Revision, Reject | Accept or Reject |

Missing `init_state.patch` alone is **not** a defect. Report `solution.patch` as a current packaging or naming issue when applicable. Do **not** rename it in Cursor Submitter Mode.

