## Difficulty Handling (Quick)

See **Difficulty Handling After Corrections** in `.cursor/rules/Review_Guidelines.mdc`.

In Cursor Submitter Mode, use difficulty policy for assessment and comments only. Do **not** rewrite the instruction, expand PR scope, or update tests/oracle in the supplied task. Report theoretical difficulty-related corrections as findings.

