## Local Validation Quick Reference

### Cursor Submitter Mode

- Default: document and logic analysis of the supplied ZIP
- Prefer supplied logs over mutation-prone local runs
- If the user explicitly requests execution, use a disposable copy only
- Never claim Docker/oracle/NOP/tests passed without evidence
- Do not run mutating commands against the original extracted task

### Reviewer

- Execution optional
- Document and logic inspection **mandatory**

